   验收标准：派活时没写，按任务本身要的结果判断
   当时发给用户的决定（why_owner=irreversible，不会默认执行）：Drop the old table?
   - 任务来历（hub 记的）：From the main conversation, 2026-11-07: “Finish the migration” · Now: migrated, old table still there
   - 选项「Drop it」：the old rows cannot be restored
   - 选项「Keep it」：40 GB stay in use
   - 推荐：Drop it
   - 等待的代价：The disk fills up in two weeks

